  m_text: "Ta l\xE0 linh h\u1ED3n canh gi\u1EEF t\xF2a th\xE1p n\xE0y. Sau tr\u1EADn
    \u0111\u1ED9ng \u0111\u1EA5t, t\xF2a th\xE1p \u0111\xE3 tr\u1ED3i l\xEAn kh\u1ECFi
    l\xF2ng \u0111\u1EA5t. Qu\xE1i v\u1EADt \u0111ang t\u1EA5n c\xF4ng th\xE0nh ph\u1ED1.
    B\xEAn trong th\xE1p c\xF3 trang b\u1ECB gi\xFAp ng\u01B0\u01A1i chi\u1EBFn \u0111\u1EA5u."
